Given: html < input id = "nameInput" type = "text" >
<button id="greetBtn">Greet</button>
<p id="message"></p>Write JavaScript that gets input value when button is clicked, Displays Hello, NAME inside paragraph, If input is empty displays Please enter your name.javascript// Get elements
const nameInput = document.getElementById("nameInput");
const greetBtn = document.getElementById("greetBtn");
const message = document.getElementById("message");

// Add click event
greetBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
    const name = nameInput.value.trim(); // get input value

    if (name === "") {
        message.textContent = "Please enter your name.";
    } else {
        message.textContent = `Hello, ${name}`;
    }
});Alternative shorter version: javascriptdocument.getElementById("greetBtn").addEventListener("click", () => {
    let name = document.getElementById("nameInput").value;
    document.getElementById("message").textContent =
        name ? `Hello, ${name}` : "Please enter your name.";
});//